\par\par \b \uc2 CORRECTED - CORRECTED-Indian rupee eases from 5-wk high on cbank presence.  \b0\par\par\uc2 441 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2005\par 13:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     In BOMBAY story headlined "Indian rupee eases from 5-wk\par high on cbank presence" please read in 3rd para ... dollar,\par down from the previous finish of 43.55/56 ... instead of ... up\par from the previous finish... (corrects direction).\par     A corrected repetition follows.\par     BOMBAY, March 15 (Reuters) - The rupee          was toppled\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 from five-week highs on Tuesday by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from the  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to absorb foreign equity inflows into Asia's  \par \par \uc2 fourth-largest economy, dealers said.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  through state-run banks and  \par \par \uc2 analysts say the Reserve Bank of India has increased dollar  \par \par \uc2 purchases in the past month and a half due to concerns about a  \par \par \uc2 widening trade deficit.  \par \par \uc2 The partially convertible rupee ended at  \par \par \uc2 43.5850/5950 per dollar, down from the previous finish of  \par \par \uc2 43.55/56, which was the highest close in five weeks.  \par \par \uc2 "There were good dollar inflows from foreign funds," said a  \par \par \uc2 chief trader at a private sector bank. "But they (the state-run  \par \par \uc2 banks) were there and have pushed the rupee down to the 43.59  \par \par \uc2 per dollar mark."  \par \par \uc2 Analysts say the rupee, which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  aims to keep  \par \par \uc2 in an unofficial 3-5 percent band, is estimated to be trading  \par \par \uc2 close to the top of that band and is overvalued by nearly 4  \par \par \uc2 percent, according to JP Morgan.  \par \par \uc2 It hit a five-year high of 43.30 in early February but the  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar purchases since then have driven it down  \par \par \uc2 0.6 percent.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lifted \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to a  \par \par \uc2 record $137.56 billion and traders say the rupee would have  \par \par \uc2 risen more but for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  soaking up the foreign  \par \par \uc2 investments.  \par \par \uc2 Foreign funds snapped up about 6 percent of India's  \par \par \uc2 second-largest mobile operator, Bharti Tele-Ventures Ltd.  \par \par \uc2 (BRTI.BO), for about $561 million on Monday, adding to the $3.3  \par \par \uc2 billion invested in shares so far this year - more than a  \par \par \uc2 third of last year's total.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     These investments are seen as partly offsetting a record\par trade deficit expected for the financial year ending March 31.\par     India's trade deficit for the April-February period widened\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 to $23.83 billion from $13.72 billion in the same period last  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 year, as the expanding economy sucked in more imports, and  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 traders are concerned firm oil prices could increase the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 deficit.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Oil prices were hovering near $55 a barrel - less than a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 dollar below a record high - a day before OPEC meets to decide  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 whether to change official output limits.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par -------------------------------------------------------------\par                                   MARKET SNAPSHOT\par     Bombay Sensitive Index\par     Indian rupee (/$)\par     7.38 percent 2015 bond (%)\par -------------------------------------------------------------.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050315e13f007yb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
