\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indian  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  reserves at record $132.96 bln.  \b0\par\par\uc2 195 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2005\par 09:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     BOMBAY, Feb 26 (Reuters) - India's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par reserves hit a record $132.96 billion on Feb. 18, eclipsing the\par previous $131.18 billion high on Dec. 31, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said\par in its weekly statistical supplement on Saturday.\par     Indian reserves, among the world's 10 biggest, rose by\par nearly $3 billion from the previous week's $129.98 billion,\par largely because of aggressive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the Reserve Bank\par of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to limit the rupee's gains.\par     "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will be one of the key reasons. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will\par not like the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to appreciate very quickly because they\par are keen to protect export competitiveness," said Manas Paul,\par chief economist at the Securities Trading Corp. of India.\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been active in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market for much of February, buying dollars to curb the rupee's\par appreciation that took it to a five-year peak of 43.30 per\par dollar at the start of the month.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     On Friday, the rupee ended at 43.7250/7400 per dollar,\par slipping from the previous day's two-week closing high of\par 43.6850/6950 because of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050226e12q00566\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
