\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee steady vs dollar, cbank trims gains.  \b0\par\par\uc2 344 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Februar 2005\par 12:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     BOMBAY, Feb 21 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee ended steady on\par Monday as a watchful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stepped in once again to\par limit the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's gains, dealers said.\par     The rupee          finished at 43.8150/8300 per dollar, a\par marginal 0.05 percent stronger than Friday's six-week closing\par low of 43.8300/8500 and well off a session peak of 43.76.\par     The local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had slipped in early trade as the market\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 anticipated the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would continue its rupee selling  \f28 \par \par \uc2 of the past two weeks but found itself wrong-footed as  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to materialise until later in the session.  \par \par \uc2 "A lot of long dollar positions built up in the morning on  \par \par \uc2 expectations that the state-run banks would come in and buy  \par \par \uc2 (for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 )," a dealer at a state-run bank said.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     "These then unwound, taking the rupee to 43.76 before the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  began."\par     Traders said foreign funds' demand for rupees also appeared\par weaker than in recent sessions, making it easier for the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to contain the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The Reserve Bank of India, which says it lets the market\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 determine the exchange rate on the partly convertible rupee and  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 only \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to smoothe out excess volatility, has kept the  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on a tight leash in the past two weeks, buying up a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 major share of the dollar inflows and swelling India's  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 reserves.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Analysts said the RBI's recent action appears to have been  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 prompted by a keenness to keep Indian exports competitive in  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the face of a burgeoning trade deficit.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Overseas portfolio investors, whose net purchases of a  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 record $8.5 billion of Indian shares in 2004 helped the rupee  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 gain 5 percent, have stepped up investments in equity this  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 month after an indifferent start to the year.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For latest foreign fund data, please  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For a story on recent Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 and it's potential impact on monetary policy, please   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par -------------------------------------------------------------\par                                   MARKET SNAPSHOT\par     Bombay Sensitive Index\par     Indian rupee (/$)\par     7.38 percent 2015 bond (%)\par -------------------------------------------------------------.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050221e12l00aw7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
